# The 3-day sample data IS committed, as ordinary git blobs (no LFS):
#   data/sample/bars_3d.npz        2.4 MB  compressed bar store
#   data/raw/daily/*.zip          32   MB  the source aggTrades archives
#   data/bars_1s/*                12   MB  expanded memmap store
# Each is far under GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, so no LFS is involved
# and `git clone` alone works offline.
#
# The FULL 2020-today dataset (~8.7 GB store + ~25 GB archives) still cannot
# live here - that travels by Snowflake stage, see btcpred.data.stage.
